# Named Catala values must denote their definitions in Z3. In particular, the
# list is not an arbitrary symbolic list and the integer is not a fresh model
# variable.

```catala-metadata
declaration enumeration Region:
  -- Allowed
  -- Forbidden

declaration allowed_regions content list of Region equals [Region.Allowed]
declaration required_code content integer equals 29

declaration scope DefinedValuesGoal:
  input region content Region
  input code content integer
  output accepted content boolean
```

```catala
scope DefinedValuesGoal:
  definition accepted equals
    if (allowed_regions contains region) and code = required_code
    then true
    else false
```
